WEBVTT

01:31.424 --> 01:34.356
[Episode 30]

01:46.760 --> 01:48.659
- Cheers.
- Alright.

01:56.280 --> 02:00.280
Meng, do you remember our promise?

02:00.280 --> 02:04.439
We promised
that if we couldn't find the right person,

02:04.439 --> 02:06.239
I would open a restaurant,

02:06.239 --> 02:08.699
and you would teach at the Women's Academy.

02:10.120 --> 02:14.340
When we got old, we would
keep each other company and not be lonely.

02:15.280 --> 02:18.780
Unexpectedly, you're going to get married.

02:21.770 --> 02:24.340
It seems we're so blessed.

02:25.960 --> 02:28.439
Zhi Li has Nian.

02:28.439 --> 02:30.360
I have His Majesty,

02:30.360 --> 02:32.259
and you have Mr. Shen.

02:33.719 --> 02:35.080
Let's have another drink.

02:35.080 --> 02:36.580
Cheers!

02:49.840 --> 02:50.840
Meng,

02:50.840 --> 02:53.319
ever since we came back from the hot spring,

02:53.319 --> 02:54.840
you've been acting strange.

02:54.840 --> 02:57.360
Is something on your mind?

02:57.360 --> 03:01.400
Would she ever keep anything from you?

03:01.400 --> 03:04.319
She must be worried about tomorrow's wedding.

03:04.319 --> 03:07.199
To wear the crown, one must bear its weight.

03:07.199 --> 03:08.960
Being an empress

03:08.960 --> 03:11.280
is not as carefree as being an official
at the Censorate.

03:11.280 --> 03:13.039
Don't worry.

03:13.039 --> 03:14.520
No matter how heavy the crown is,

03:14.520 --> 03:17.080
we will all support you.

03:17.080 --> 03:18.719
That's right.

03:18.719 --> 03:20.879
His Majesty protects you in the court.

03:20.879 --> 03:23.280
Zhi Shu and Nian guard you in the palace,

03:23.280 --> 03:25.840
and Fu Zhi and I are around you.

03:25.840 --> 03:28.479
And Yin Qing makes you laugh.

03:28.479 --> 03:32.319
The entire Censorate
will always have your back.

03:32.319 --> 03:33.819
Come on.

03:37.719 --> 03:39.219
Cheers!

03:43.719 --> 03:45.219
Cheers!

03:51.680 --> 03:54.280
I'm just afraid this is all but a dream,

03:54.280 --> 03:58.900
and when I wake up, everything will be gone.

04:06.800 --> 04:08.479
Meng,

04:08.479 --> 04:11.240
if you ever feel unhappy in the palace,

04:11.240 --> 04:12.919
just come back to Bofeng House.

04:12.919 --> 04:14.960
This will always be a home for you.

04:14.960 --> 04:17.000
I will always shield you.

04:17.000 --> 04:19.600
I don't wish you prosperity.

04:19.600 --> 04:23.860
I only wish you happiness and health.

04:24.519 --> 04:28.399
Meng, whether you are Director Meng

04:28.399 --> 04:30.879
or the empress,

04:30.879 --> 04:32.399
in my heart,

04:32.399 --> 04:35.480
you will always be my best friend
who guided my growth

04:35.480 --> 04:37.540
and protected me in every way.

04:38.279 --> 04:43.259
You will forever be the girl
I am proud of and admire most.

04:53.000 --> 04:55.920
Alright, tomorrow is your wedding day,

04:55.920 --> 04:57.480
so cheer up!

04:57.480 --> 04:58.980
Come on.

05:03.920 --> 05:07.259
Here is to our empress.

05:09.079 --> 05:12.379
And to the night of drinking like this.

05:41.399 --> 05:43.968
Your Highness, by this time tomorrow,

05:43.968 --> 05:48.459
all the lanterns in the capital will
be replaced with white mourning banners.

05:50.519 --> 05:53.720
The eight-year blood debt shall be repaid.

05:53.720 --> 05:55.519
In the Battle of Humen Pass back then,

05:55.519 --> 05:57.560
Ying Gua, as the Crown Prince,

05:57.560 --> 06:00.360
shot an arrow through my uncle's throat,

06:00.360 --> 06:03.019
ruining the fortunes of my mother's clan.

06:04.240 --> 06:08.379
Since then, my father
has been paying attention to my brother only.

06:09.680 --> 06:12.000
Who does he think he is?

06:12.000 --> 06:15.360
He is just a coward hiding in the royal tent
and playing political games.

06:15.360 --> 06:19.319
Your Highness, the time for revenge has come.

06:19.319 --> 06:21.160
Xu Ting firmly believes

06:21.160 --> 06:22.720
Your Highness has come to offer warhorses

06:22.720 --> 06:24.620
and promote a marriage alliance.

06:25.519 --> 06:26.519
[Imperial Permit to the Capital]

06:26.519 --> 06:28.920
I've obtained the city-opening token.

06:28.920 --> 06:31.439
Just wait for the signal tomorrow,

06:31.439 --> 06:33.600
and our assassination squad

06:33.600 --> 06:35.759
will head straight for the capital.

06:35.759 --> 06:37.259
Yes.

06:42.000 --> 06:44.019
Your Highness,
sorry to have kept you waiting.

06:47.120 --> 06:49.959
Mr. Shangguan,
you actually approached me so quietly

06:49.959 --> 06:53.439
that even our Wind Listeners
couldn't detect your presence.

06:53.439 --> 06:55.360
Very impressive!

06:55.360 --> 06:57.439
I'm flattered.

06:57.439 --> 06:58.639
To remind you,

06:58.639 --> 07:01.420
what you should care about
is tomorrow's operation.

07:05.240 --> 07:06.839
During the wedding tomorrow,

07:06.839 --> 07:10.560
the escort procession must pass
through Changle Street from the Censorate.

07:10.560 --> 07:13.360
We've turned the leader of the escort guards.

07:13.360 --> 07:16.360
At that time, he will use the pretext
of searching for assassins

07:16.360 --> 07:18.199
to divert half of the Imperial Guards.

07:18.199 --> 07:19.839
There are crisscrossing lanes there,

07:19.839 --> 07:22.459
and Ying Gua will die there.

07:24.120 --> 07:25.279
Mr. Shangguan,

07:25.279 --> 07:28.800
are you sure your ambush is foolproof?

07:28.800 --> 07:31.480
Ying Gua is as cunning as a fox.

07:31.480 --> 07:35.560
Back then, with 3,000 light cavalrymen,
he lured my 30,000 troops into a death trap.

07:35.560 --> 07:38.439
If this is a setup again,

07:38.439 --> 07:40.759
you and I will be trapped.

07:40.759 --> 07:42.399
Since I work from the inside with you,

07:42.399 --> 07:44.399
you can rest assured.

07:44.399 --> 07:46.319
Your Highness,
you'll lead your troops to fight head-on

07:46.319 --> 07:48.720
while my men already lie in ambush,

07:48.720 --> 07:51.480
responsible for contacting the princess.

07:51.480 --> 07:54.000
Even if Ying Gua makes a perfect plan,

07:54.000 --> 07:58.459
his wedding feast will be his last meal.

07:59.759 --> 08:01.300
Interesting.

08:03.519 --> 08:07.040
Though we have worked until now,

08:07.040 --> 08:09.199
I have yet to see your true face.

08:09.199 --> 08:11.240
When Zhongwan is restored,

08:11.240 --> 08:16.100
my face, hidden for ten years,
will naturally be shown.

08:17.279 --> 08:21.620
At that time, I'll drink with you
to honor Ying Gua's death.

08:26.439 --> 08:28.279
The hour of You has passed.

08:28.279 --> 08:30.839
Ying Gua is about to die.

08:30.839 --> 08:34.940
The Ning Empire should also come to an end.

08:43.440 --> 08:48.700
This time,
I'll personally cut off Ying Gua's head.

08:50.559 --> 08:52.120
This is the grand wedding

08:52.120 --> 08:53.559
of the emperor and empress.

08:53.559 --> 08:54.879
Today, betrothal gifts are prepared

08:54.879 --> 08:57.120
to display the emperor's sincerity

08:57.120 --> 08:59.720
and to honor the empress's virtue.

08:59.720 --> 09:02.759
The gifts include
ten bolts of high-quality silk brocade,

09:02.759 --> 09:04.639
a pair of blue jade nuptial cups,

09:04.639 --> 09:07.039
a pair of kingfisher feather vases,

09:07.039 --> 09:08.759
one black pearl,

09:08.759 --> 09:10.679
one jade scepter,

09:10.679 --> 09:14.159
and a set of golden phoenix hairpins,
symbolizing happiness.

09:14.159 --> 09:17.000
Will I still be able to see you often?

09:17.000 --> 09:18.919
Your Majesty.

09:18.919 --> 09:22.039
Of course, I will always be your Meng.

09:22.039 --> 09:23.840
We promised not to cry today.

09:23.840 --> 09:26.460
We must happily see Meng off.

09:28.360 --> 09:30.519
The auspicious hour is approaching.

09:30.519 --> 09:33.940
We respectfully welcome Her Majesty.

11:12.519 --> 11:16.759
I never thought the story in the storybooks
would actually come true.

11:16.759 --> 11:20.399
Shun, go buy me some text books.

11:20.399 --> 11:22.519
Why, madam?

11:22.519 --> 11:25.740
I'll also take the imperial exam
and become a scholar next year.

11:39.399 --> 11:42.539
Your Highness,
the carriage has reached the street corner.

11:43.559 --> 11:46.179
Look, how grand!

11:48.279 --> 11:50.740
Prepare to die, Ying Gua!

11:56.759 --> 11:58.500
Run!

13:07.679 --> 13:12.340
Did you think killing me
would end everything?

13:16.240 --> 13:18.259
Return to the Sacred Ancestral Hall
to protect His Majesty!

13:21.240 --> 13:23.000
The auspicious hour has arrived.

13:23.000 --> 13:27.899
Welcome the emperor and empress
into the hall to announce the ancestors.

13:55.919 --> 13:59.580
Please offer incense.

14:21.279 --> 14:24.899
First bow to the ancestors
who expanded the land.

14:28.000 --> 14:29.879
<i>Yao.</i>

14:29.879 --> 14:33.539
Second bow
for the eternal stability of the land.

14:40.320 --> 14:42.480
Third bow for your lifelong commitment.

14:42.480 --> 14:45.100
<i>Yao, kill him.</i>

14:46.600 --> 14:47.600
Concluded.

14:47.600 --> 14:50.419
<i>Yao, kill him.</i>

14:51.639 --> 14:54.960
<i>Yao, kill him.</i>

14:54.960 --> 14:58.360
<i>Yao, he is the enemy
who destroyed your country.</i>

14:58.360 --> 15:00.799
<i>Kill him, Yao.</i>

15:00.799 --> 15:04.500
<i>He is the enemy who destroyed your country.
Kill him.</i>

15:20.200 --> 15:23.659
<i>Yao, kill him.</i>

15:27.279 --> 15:28.779
Your Majesty!

15:31.279 --> 15:33.200
Guards! Protect His Majesty!

15:33.200 --> 15:34.360
Your Majesty!

15:34.360 --> 15:36.860
Meng, what's wrong with you?

16:25.200 --> 16:26.919
Back off, you lot!

16:26.919 --> 16:29.899
Otherwise, your emperor will die!

17:10.279 --> 17:11.920
Stop playing tricks!

17:11.920 --> 17:13.440
Who exactly are you?

17:13.440 --> 17:16.339
How dare you assassinate His Majesty here!

17:17.200 --> 17:22.039
Over ten years ago,
you killed 100,000 people in my country.

17:22.039 --> 17:23.643
Did you

17:24.874 --> 17:26.500
forget your blood debt?

17:34.079 --> 17:36.539
Zhongwan remnants!

17:37.200 --> 17:38.960
You destroyed my country,

17:38.960 --> 17:41.279
yet call us remnants.

17:41.279 --> 17:44.200
Today, I will use the blood of your emperor

17:44.200 --> 17:46.680
to rest the souls of my people.

17:46.680 --> 17:48.660
I'll kill you!

18:55.759 --> 18:58.460
Yin Qing? How could it be you?

19:05.480 --> 19:07.839
After hiding for so long,

19:07.839 --> 19:09.839
you finally show yourself today.

19:09.839 --> 19:12.900
Do you really think this is a place
you can come and go as you please?

19:20.519 --> 19:23.019
Meng, you already knew about this?

19:31.720 --> 19:34.674
Yin Qing,

19:34.674 --> 19:36.000
I already replaced your incense
three days ago.

19:36.000 --> 19:38.039
Today, I used myself as bait to set this trap

19:38.039 --> 19:40.680
to lure all of you out.

19:40.680 --> 19:42.960
Do you know how long
I have waited for this moment?

19:42.960 --> 19:46.420
You actually worked with him to set us up!

20:14.359 --> 20:15.920
Your Majesty,

20:15.920 --> 20:18.039
the nine gates of the Sacred Ancestral Hall
have been sealed.

20:18.039 --> 20:20.759
Today, they cannot escape.

20:20.759 --> 20:23.200
The Second Prince of Beijian
and his men have been annihilated.

20:23.200 --> 20:25.880
The Blood Moon Society
no longer has any support.

20:25.880 --> 20:27.079
What exactly happened?

20:27.079 --> 20:28.640
Lord Xu,

20:28.640 --> 20:31.319
you secretly issued a tributary credential,

20:31.319 --> 20:33.400
helping the Second Prince of Beijian

20:33.400 --> 20:36.079
work with the Blood Moon Society
and lead troops to infiltrate the capital.

20:36.079 --> 20:37.720
Your Majesty, allow me to explain.

20:37.720 --> 20:41.359
I must have fallen for a trap
to have signed that credential.

20:41.359 --> 20:45.819
Your Majesty, the priority is
to exterminate the Zhongwan remnants!

20:46.720 --> 20:48.220
Ying Gua,

20:49.039 --> 20:51.359
since I came here today,

20:51.359 --> 20:53.660
I never planned to leave alive.

20:54.720 --> 20:56.220
Seize them!

21:14.839 --> 21:16.975
Yin Qing, stop now.

21:16.975 --> 21:19.920
- Don't do anything you'll regret!
- It's you who will regret!

21:19.920 --> 21:22.200
I suffered so much
and planned every step carefully,

21:22.200 --> 21:24.559
helping you become the most powerful person.

21:24.559 --> 21:29.119
Today, just by killing Ying Gua,
we can restore Zhongwan.

21:29.119 --> 21:32.380
It will only make countless people homeless.

21:33.039 --> 21:36.400
I prefer to give up the blood feud then.

21:36.400 --> 21:37.909
Besides,

21:38.606 --> 21:41.099
I am now a member of the Ning Empire.

21:42.240 --> 21:45.000
Director Meng is actually
in league with the Blood Moon Society?

21:45.000 --> 21:46.960
That's absolutely not true!

21:46.960 --> 21:50.559
Seize all remnants of Blood Moon Society!

21:50.559 --> 21:52.619
You forced me to do this!

22:30.160 --> 22:32.200
All of you, look closely.

22:32.200 --> 22:35.759
Do you truly want her to be your empress?

22:35.759 --> 22:38.380
The Black Bird tattoo?

22:39.839 --> 22:42.920
That's the mark of the Zhongwan royals!

22:42.920 --> 22:45.160
You are the princess of Zhongwan!

22:45.160 --> 22:50.000
A foreign princess has actually been
stirring up things in our country.

22:50.000 --> 22:53.000
Guards! Execute her on the spot!

22:53.000 --> 22:55.140
Who dares?

22:56.440 --> 22:57.940
Your Majesty,

22:58.559 --> 23:01.819
did you already know about her identity?

23:02.440 --> 23:03.799
Your Majesty,

23:03.799 --> 23:08.359
are you going to hand over the Ning Empire
to the Zhongwan remnants?

23:08.359 --> 23:12.160
Meng Ting Hui previously
did not know her origins,

23:12.160 --> 23:15.240
but I'm clear about every single thing

23:15.240 --> 23:17.359
she did for the Ning Empire.

23:17.359 --> 23:19.599
Drop the act, Princess.

23:19.599 --> 23:22.200
We plotted the Eternity Pill trouble,

23:22.200 --> 23:23.920
Gu Qin's execution,

23:23.920 --> 23:25.880
and the failure
of the marriage alliance with Beijian.

23:25.880 --> 23:29.079
It's all to make internal
and external conflicts here.

23:29.079 --> 23:32.119
Did you think
that by driving her into a corner

23:32.119 --> 23:34.160
and pinning all the disasters on her,

23:34.160 --> 23:36.000
she would join you to restore your country?

23:36.000 --> 23:39.920
You keep her by your side just to use her,
don't you?

23:39.920 --> 23:43.119
There will always be 100,000 dead souls
between you two.

23:43.119 --> 23:45.359
You can never be together.

23:45.359 --> 23:47.480
Your Majesty, enough talking.

23:47.480 --> 23:49.680
Quickly kill the evil woman
and the Zhongwan remnants

23:49.680 --> 23:51.240
once and for all!

23:51.240 --> 23:54.099
Since you say I'm an evil woman
who brings disaster to the country,

24:07.640 --> 24:10.000
today, I will cut out my Black Bird tattoo

24:10.000 --> 24:11.720
to show you my loyalty.

24:11.720 --> 24:13.220
Don't!

24:50.200 --> 24:52.539
The Black Bird tattoo is destroyed.

24:53.559 --> 24:55.700
I am no longer a princess of Zhongwan.

24:56.799 --> 24:58.940
I am just Meng Ting Hui.

25:44.200 --> 25:45.700
Lord Xu!

25:47.759 --> 25:49.960
If you want to kill our emperor,

25:49.960 --> 25:53.220
you must step over my body first.

26:05.160 --> 26:08.160
Lord Xu!

26:08.160 --> 26:10.160
Lord Xu, wake up!

26:10.160 --> 26:12.079
Get the imperial physician. Quickly!

26:12.079 --> 26:13.200
Yes! Imperial physician!

26:13.200 --> 26:14.700
- Your Majesty.
- Imperial physician!

26:20.400 --> 26:22.140
Your Majesty,

26:23.119 --> 26:25.380
I was wrong before.

26:27.200 --> 26:29.339
Do not blame me.

26:40.799 --> 26:42.700
I can't

26:44.440 --> 26:47.539
serve Your Majesty anymore.

26:48.160 --> 26:49.960
Lord Xu!

26:49.960 --> 26:52.019
Lord Xu!

26:56.200 --> 27:00.940
Lord Xu!

27:05.279 --> 27:06.940
Lord Xu!

27:15.519 --> 27:19.519
Princess, we should be happy.

27:19.519 --> 27:23.660
I have avenged you and my sister.

27:46.920 --> 27:52.779
Execute these remnants!

28:54.440 --> 28:58.660
Xu Ting died, so your heart hurts?

29:00.319 --> 29:05.240
When your troops massacred our people,

29:05.240 --> 29:08.160
can you imagine how I felt back then?

29:08.160 --> 29:09.720
You and I,

29:09.720 --> 29:13.460
Zhongwan and Ning Empire,
are irreconcilable enemies.

29:14.920 --> 29:18.779
Since our deep blood feud cannot be settled,

29:19.720 --> 29:26.099
today, I will use your life to end it all.

29:50.440 --> 29:52.240
Mr. Shangguan!

29:52.240 --> 29:53.240
Your Majesty!

29:53.240 --> 29:54.740
Meng!

30:00.559 --> 30:03.579
Hasn't there been enough killing
between Ning Empire and Zhongwan?

30:05.640 --> 30:08.099
Your Majesty, please spare Yin Qing's life.

30:08.720 --> 30:11.660
I personally gave you the hairpin,

30:12.960 --> 30:15.440
yet you actually use it to threaten me.

30:15.440 --> 30:18.039
I know Your Majesty hates Yin Qing,

30:18.039 --> 30:21.099
but I cannot watch him die.

30:21.960 --> 30:26.240
I cannot watch the hatred
between the two countries grow deeper.

30:26.240 --> 30:28.920
Lord Xu died protecting me.

30:28.920 --> 30:31.119
If I don't kill him today,

30:31.119 --> 30:34.400
how can I guard the land
and protect the people?

30:34.400 --> 30:38.099
Today, he must die!

30:39.799 --> 30:41.039
Stop!

30:41.039 --> 30:46.339
I am protecting Yin Qing
for the sake of Ning Empire as well.

30:49.880 --> 30:52.240
Your Majesty, do not listen to Meng Ting Hui!

30:52.240 --> 30:54.119
You absolutely must not let them go.

30:54.119 --> 30:57.920
I implore Your Majesty
to execute her and her followers

30:57.920 --> 30:59.240
for the sake of national stability.

30:59.240 --> 31:02.559
Your Majesty,
sparing them is a recipe for disaster.

31:02.559 --> 31:05.880
Today, we mustn't let them leave alive.

31:05.880 --> 31:08.279
Nian, do you have to be so ruthless?

31:08.279 --> 31:10.240
Your Majesty, these people survived back then

31:10.240 --> 31:11.720
and stirred up trouble.

31:11.720 --> 31:13.079
You must not let it happen again.

31:13.079 --> 31:15.640
Zhi Shu,
you know Meng won't hurt His Majesty.

31:15.640 --> 31:17.759
- I beg you--
- We implore Your Majesty

31:17.759 --> 31:20.519
to execute the princess and her followers

31:20.519 --> 31:22.579
for the sake of national stability!

32:13.759 --> 32:15.799
The phoenix pendant is broken,

32:15.799 --> 32:18.200
and you and I are over.

32:18.200 --> 32:21.180
I'll never yield a single inch of my land.

32:24.319 --> 32:26.240
Let them go.

32:26.240 --> 32:27.819
Your Majesty!

33:58.799 --> 34:00.799
The throne shook.

34:00.799 --> 34:02.880
The evil woman escaped.

34:02.880 --> 34:05.119
The loyal minister died.

34:05.119 --> 34:07.079
The border defense collapsed.

34:07.079 --> 34:09.159
An infatuated emperor

34:09.159 --> 34:11.440
destroys the land.

34:11.440 --> 34:13.440
The throne shook.

34:13.440 --> 34:15.400
The evil woman escaped.

34:15.400 --> 34:17.559
The loyal minister died.

34:17.559 --> 34:19.800
The border defense collapsed.

34:19.800 --> 34:22.925
[Chunman House]

34:24.608 --> 34:26.516
[Bofeng House]

34:45.440 --> 34:46.440
Ms. Yan,

34:46.440 --> 34:49.579
will Miss Meng restore her country
and attack us?

34:50.840 --> 34:51.840
- Ms. Yan.
- Madam!

34:51.840 --> 34:54.000
Terrible news! There's going to be a war!

34:54.000 --> 34:56.840
My relatives at the border say
they've seen enemy troops.

34:56.840 --> 34:58.840
Then we should quickly stock up on food.

34:58.840 --> 35:01.639
If a war really breaks out,
food will be lifesaving.

35:01.639 --> 35:03.139
Yes, you're right.

35:07.639 --> 35:08.639
Your Majesty.

35:08.639 --> 35:10.219
No need for formalities.

35:11.000 --> 35:12.500
Please take a seat.

35:18.119 --> 35:22.519
You must have already heard
that they call me a fatuous ruler.

35:22.519 --> 35:24.039
In my view,

35:24.039 --> 35:26.079
Your Majesty is using the land
as a chessboard,

35:26.079 --> 35:27.440
and benevolence as bait.

35:27.440 --> 35:29.000
This is great wisdom.

35:29.000 --> 35:30.679
I heard from Zhi Shu

35:30.679 --> 35:33.719
that Your Majesty will issue a new policy
for Zhongwan.

35:33.719 --> 35:36.360
All who surrender will not be slaves anymore,
have fertile land,

35:36.360 --> 35:39.360
and be allowed to become officials
through the Imperial Exams.

35:39.360 --> 35:43.880
It's to show our sincerity
to the Zhongwan remnants.

35:43.880 --> 35:45.840
I will bear the infamy,

35:45.840 --> 35:50.400
but the game must be played by my rules.

35:50.400 --> 35:53.019
Your Majesty,
are you going to the battlefield?

35:54.480 --> 35:56.960
Now, with both chancellor positions vacant,
the court is in turmoil.

35:56.960 --> 35:59.000
Moreover, Beijian has vicious ambitions,

35:59.000 --> 36:01.480
colluding with Zhongwan remnants
to assassinate Your Majesty.

36:01.480 --> 36:02.880
You will be in grave danger.

36:02.880 --> 36:04.199
You can't leave the capital.

36:04.199 --> 36:06.119
I invited you over

36:06.119 --> 36:08.039
precisely to ask you to oversee the court,

36:08.039 --> 36:10.500
command the six ministries,
and stabilize the government.

36:11.559 --> 36:13.880
That day, I let Yin Qing go,

36:13.880 --> 36:15.440
but it was not for Meng Ting Hui.

36:15.440 --> 36:17.480
Yin Qing is the leader
of the Zhongwan remnants.

36:17.480 --> 36:19.639
If I killed him on the spot,

36:19.639 --> 36:22.320
it would incite the hatred of the remnants,

36:22.320 --> 36:23.840
and then we would face a joint attack

36:23.840 --> 36:26.159
from Zhongwan and Beijian.

36:26.159 --> 36:28.119
The war with Beijian is inevitable,

36:28.119 --> 36:30.860
so we might as well strike first.

36:31.719 --> 36:33.280
Moreover, that day,

36:33.280 --> 36:35.000
Meng Ting Hui also risked her life.

36:35.000 --> 36:36.000
She was betting

36:36.000 --> 36:38.039
that I could find a third path,

36:38.039 --> 36:41.639
a path different from how my father
handled the clashes between two countries.

36:41.639 --> 36:44.280
When you taught me how to rule over the land,

36:44.280 --> 36:46.000
you said the true ruler

36:46.000 --> 36:48.760
should be magnanimous.

36:48.760 --> 36:51.719
I wish to unify this fractured land

36:51.719 --> 36:54.099
and bring people peace and prosperity.

36:59.400 --> 37:03.980
So, will you help me play this game?

37:09.519 --> 37:11.239
I once said

37:11.239 --> 37:14.739
the land is the chessboard,
and the ruler is the player.

37:16.039 --> 37:22.500
I am willing to play this chess game
for Your Majesty.

37:26.679 --> 37:29.219
I have retired for ten years.

37:30.239 --> 37:32.099
I truly never expected

37:33.119 --> 37:37.320
that I could still serve Your Majesty

37:37.320 --> 37:40.639
and the country.

37:40.639 --> 37:42.559
With your support,

37:42.559 --> 37:45.360
I can campaign without worries.

37:45.360 --> 37:47.079
From this day forward,

37:47.079 --> 37:50.360
you will govern
and command the six ministries.

37:50.360 --> 37:53.840
I will not fail your trust.

37:53.840 --> 37:57.840
I will do my utmost to guard the country

37:57.840 --> 38:00.099
and await Your Majesty's triumphant return.

38:00.760 --> 38:01.760
Your Majesty,

38:01.760 --> 38:03.760
Yin Qing and the others
have infiltrated their old land in Qingzhou.

38:03.760 --> 38:06.159
Beijian has troops at the border,
but they don't attack.

38:06.159 --> 38:08.480
Yeqi's army is conducting a show of force
at Qingxia Pass.

38:08.480 --> 38:10.320
Taishui's cavalry
raided our Jizhou camp by night,

38:10.320 --> 38:12.000
burning three of our military granaries.

38:12.000 --> 38:14.219
War broke out, and there is no time to lose.

38:16.039 --> 38:18.159
Our soldiers will advance
in three directions.

38:18.159 --> 38:20.519
Shen Zhi Shu,
lead your troops straight to Yeqi

38:20.519 --> 38:21.559
and tell their king

38:21.559 --> 38:25.119
to weigh whether to be our enemy or ally.

38:25.119 --> 38:26.119
As you command.

38:26.119 --> 38:28.519
Di Nian,
lead the elite troops directly to Taishui.

38:28.519 --> 38:30.480
You must break through the city
within seven days.

38:30.480 --> 38:32.159
I will not let you down!

38:32.159 --> 38:34.519
Your Majesty, once the Second Prince's body
returns to his country,

38:34.519 --> 38:35.840
Beijian will surely use this
as an excuse to attack.

38:35.840 --> 38:37.000
Then our army will be attacked
front and rear.

38:37.000 --> 38:38.639
We don't need to wait for Beijian to come.

38:38.639 --> 38:41.559
In three days,
I will lead the campaign against Beijian.

38:41.559 --> 38:43.360
I will let them know

38:43.360 --> 38:46.099
that Ning Empire is not a place
they can attack at will.

38:48.000 --> 38:50.199
I volunteer to be the vanguard.

38:50.199 --> 38:52.400
Lord Xu was quite good to me.

38:52.400 --> 38:54.300
I must avenge his death.

38:55.119 --> 38:58.679
I will do it at any cost.

38:58.679 --> 39:00.760
Good.

39:00.760 --> 39:03.880
Soldiers, with powerful enemies around us,

39:03.880 --> 39:06.760
a step back leads to the loss of land,

39:06.760 --> 39:10.000
while a step forward
creates an unbeatable line of defense.

39:10.000 --> 39:12.679
I will live or die together
with all the soldiers.

39:12.679 --> 39:15.119
Defend our territory!

39:15.119 --> 39:17.159
Protect our people!

39:17.159 --> 39:18.800
Defend our territory!

39:18.800 --> 39:20.440
Protect our people!

39:20.440 --> 39:22.119
Defend our territory!

39:22.119 --> 39:23.800
Protect our people!

39:23.800 --> 39:25.480
Defend our territory!

39:25.480 --> 39:27.659
Protect our people!

39:39.920 --> 39:41.420
Your Highness,

39:42.440 --> 39:45.380
this is where you used to live as a child.

39:46.400 --> 39:48.239
Do you remember?

39:48.239 --> 39:50.099
I've seen it in my dreams.

39:55.480 --> 40:00.519
Here are the spirit tablets
of the Zhongwan royals and loyal martyrs.

40:00.519 --> 40:05.360
Every midnight, we can hear their weeping.

40:05.360 --> 40:07.300
After Zhongwan fell,

40:08.000 --> 40:10.360
this place was neglected by Ning Empire.

40:10.360 --> 40:12.599
We secretly quartered here.

40:12.599 --> 40:18.340
On the first night,
hearing voices drove many of our people mad.

40:23.320 --> 40:26.500
Mr. Shangguan,
the clan chief has been expecting you.
